        <mxCell id="eIbLOLDBZuPLv1AVxypd-62" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=0;" value="MY NAME IS PHANTASMO ELIXTERSON REGINALD DRAVENOR THE FIFTEENTH!&lt;div&gt;I COME FROM A LONG LINE OF PROUD DRAVENORS THAT HAVE HAUNTED YOUR MIND FOR GENERATIONS!&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;MY FAMILY NAME HAS STRUCK FEAR IN DEMONOLOGISTS FOR CENTURIES AND WILL CONTINUE TO DO SO UNTIL THE INEVITABLE FALL OF...&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;I mean, I enjoy pinacoladas, getting caught in the rain and I hate yoga.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="509" x="340" y="735" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
