        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="eIbLOLDBZuPLv1AVxypd-66" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=0;" value="My father used to tell people just before he killed them:&lt;div&gt;&quot;He who gazes upon death too long, shall soon find themselves its subject&quot;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;I never got why he told them AFTER it was too late.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
